For your view, you can use the null-conditional operator (`?.`) to call `ToShortDateString()` only when `Birth` has a value:

```csharp
var dob = Birth?.ToShortDateString();
```

Just make sure that `Birth` is declared as a nullable `DateTime` (`DateTime?`) in your model as well.

Also, depending on what you need, you can use `??` to provide a fallback value:

```csharp
var dob = Birth?.ToShortDateString() ?? "";
```

Or use an explicit `HasValue` check.

